    non-Tuner with a lower Level, and if you do, Special Summon 1 Synchro Monster
    from your Extra Deck with a Level equal to the difference in Levels of those
    monsters (this is treated as a Synchro Summon), then you can destroy 1 card your
    opponent controls.'
